        <mxCell id="k08_sub" value="顺序写、PageCache、零拷贝、批量压缩、分区并行；稀疏索引只负责让查找不拖后腿。" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13.5;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=PingFang SC;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="82" y="82" width="1330" height="24" as="geometry" />
